@startuml
title ROV 控制周期时序图（Teleop → ManualController → PWM → STM32）

actor Operator as op

participant "TeleopInputProvider\n(io::TeleopInputProvider)" as teleop
participant "ControlLoop\n(control_core::ControlLoop)" as loop
participant "ManualController\n(controllers::ManualController)" as ctrl
participant "PwmClient\n(platform::PwmClient)" as pwmc
participant "pwm_control.c\n(安全层)" as safelayer
participant "libpwm_host\n(orangepi_send)" as hostlib
participant "PwmLogger\n(io::PwmLogger)" as logger
participant "STM32 通信任务\n(UDP 接收+解析)" as stm32comm
participant "STM32 PWM 输出\n(TIM/中断)" as stm32pwm
participant "ESC & Thrusters\n8x" as thr

== 预备：循环已启动 ==

op -> teleop : 按下键位（W/A/S/D/...）
note right of teleop
  TeleopInputProvider 内部更新
  归一化 6-DOF 指令 dof_cmd
end note

loop -> loop : tick 定时触发\n(根据 loop_hz)

== Step 1: 读取输入 ==
loop -> teleop : poll(state, ref, request_exit)
teleop --> loop : 填充 ControlReference.dof_cmd\n并设置 use_dof_cmd = true

== Step 2: 控制器计算 ==
loop -> ctrl : compute(state, ref, output, dt)
note right of ctrl
  ManualController:
   - 读取 ref.dof_cmd
   - 做限幅/增益缩放
   - 填写 output.thruster_command[8]
   - 置 has_thruster_command = true
end note
ctrl --> loop : ControlOutput

== Step 3: 设置 PWM 目标 ==
loop -> pwmc : setTargets(output.thruster_command[8])
pwmc --> pwmc : 更新内部目标占空比\n(仅更新，不立即下发)

== Step 4: 安全层 step 下发 ==
loop -> pwmc : step()
pwmc -> safelayer : pwm_ctrl_step()
note right of safelayer
  - 限斜率（max_step_pct）
  - 越零保护（禁止直接反转）
  - AB 分组交替更新
  - 心跳/超时检测
end note

safelayer -> hostlib : pwm_host_set_all_pct(\n  当前安全占空比[8]\n)
hostlib -> stm32comm : UDP 帧发送\n(PWM 指令 + 心跳)

stm32comm -> stm32comm : 解析帧 / 校验 CRC
stm32comm -> stm32pwm : 更新目标 PWM 寄存器
stm32pwm -> thr : 物理 PWM 输出\n(驱动 8 个 ESC/推进器)

== Step 5: PWM 日志记录 ==
loop -> logger : log(t_s, output.thruster_command[8])
note right of logger
  写入 CSV:
   - 相对时间 t_s
   - 8 路逻辑 PWM 指令
end note

== Step 6: 下一周期 ==
loop -> loop : sleep_until(next_tick)

@enduml
